//Existing abilities.
@1000 = ~Called Shot~
@1001 = ~When making a Called Shot, an archer attempts to hamper fighting ability or mobility. For one round, the archer takes a -4 penalty to attack rolls, but his first successful ranged attack carries dire consequences for his opponent. Targets struck are allowed a save at +2 bonus to reduce the effects. At 8th level and every other 4 levels the saving throw difficulty class improves by 1, up to -2 penalty at 20th level.~

@1010 = ~Disarm~
@1011 = ~With this attack, the archer chooses to impede fighting ability. When hit, the target will suffer a -4 penalty to hit rolls for 6 rounds. If a save vs. breath is made the duration is halved. At 10th level, any target who fails the save is also unable to attack for 1 round. At 20th level, any target who fails the save will also have his strength reduced by 50% for 1 turn.~

@1020 = ~Trip~
@1021 = ~With this attack, the archer chooses to impede mobility. When hit, the target will suffer a -50% penalty to movement speed for 6 rounds. If a save vs. death is made the duration is halved. At 10th level, any target who fails the save is also knocked down for 1 round. At 20th level, any target who fails the save will also have his dexterity reduced by 50% for 1 turn.~

//Changed abilities.
@1100 = ~Bow Mastery~
@1101 = ~With this ability the Archer gains a permanent bonus of +1 to missile thac0 and damage.~

@1110 = ~Evasive Archer~
@1111 = ~With this ability the Archer gains a permanent bonus of +1 to missile armor class.~


//Spells.
@1200 = ~Feather Step~
@1201 = ~Level: 1
School: Alteration
Range: Personal
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

When the archer casts this spell, for a brief moment he gains extraordinary speed, usually to escape the enemies' reach and relocate to a more convenient spot in the battlefield. For two rounds, his movement speed is doubled and as a consequence, he gains a bonus of +2 to ranged ac and saves vs. breath. During this period he cannot cast any spells, has less an attack per round and suffers a penalty of -4 to thac0 and damage rolls.~

@1210 = ~Fashion Arrows~
@1211 = ~Level: 2
School: Conjuration
Range: Personal
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

With this spell, the Archer conjures a full stack of magically enchanted arrows, bullets or bolts. The magic lasts for 8 hours, after which the arrows become unusable. This spell can only be cast outdoors and outside of combat.~

//Auxiliary spells.
@1212 = ~Frost Arrows +1~
@1213 = ~Create a stack of magical Frost Arrows +1.~

@1214 = ~Poison Arrows +1~
@1215 = ~Create a stack of magical Poison Arrows +1.~

@1216 = ~Flaming Arrows +2~
@1217 = ~Create a stack of magical Flaming Arrows +2.~

@1218 = ~Acidic Arrows +3~
@1219 = ~Create a stack of magical Acidic Arrows +3.~

@1220 = ~Falcon's Eye~
@1221 = ~Level: 3
School: Alteration
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 Turn
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

When this ability is used, the ranger's eyes gain the magical acuity of a falcon, enhancing his vision and allow him to accurately read the weaknesses of creatures. For 1 turn, the Archer gain a bonus of +2 to ranged thac0 and damage, and +1 to the ranged critical range. Furthermore, any critical ranged hit knocks down the victim unconscious for 1 round. The intense concentration required leaves the Archer more vulnerable to attacks, suffering a penalty of +4 to ac.~

@1300 = ~Frost Bullets +1~
@1301 = ~Create a stack of magical Frost Bullets +1.~

@1310 = ~Flaming Bullets +2~
@1311 = ~Create a stack of magical Flaming Bullets +2.~

@1320 = ~Crushing Bullets +3~
@1321 = ~Create a stack of magical Crushing Bullets +3.~

@1330 = ~Frost Bolts +1~
